Package: libeltako0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Eltako Series 14 bus library and tools
 Shared library for EnOcean-style frames on the Eltako Series 14 bus
 (buttons, dimmers, and blinds) over a serial gateway.
 .
 This package also installs eltakod, eltako-send, and eltako-dump.
 eltakod includes libvsb and libevquick, so it does not need those
 libraries installed separately.

Package: libeltako-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libeltako0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: development files for libeltako
 Headers and pkg-config file for building against libeltako.
